# /api/* is handled by Pages Functions automatically and is not affected
# by anything in this file.
#
# There is intentionally no catch-all rewrite rule here for client-side
# routes (e.g. "/* /index.html 200"). As of writing, Cloudflare's own
# tooling has an open bug that incorrectly flags that exact pattern as an
# "infinite loop" and can block deployment:
#   https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/10992
#   https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/11824
#
# Instead, `npm run build` copies dist/index.html to dist/404.html, and
# Cloudflare Pages serves that automatically for any unmatched path so
# React Router can take over client-side. See README.md for details.
